lion in free cash flow over the trailing nine-month period) while maintaining high returns on equity, making it a stellar compounder in financial services.  4. **KO (The Coca-Cola Company) - Rank 4**    - **The Bull Case:** Coca-Cola represents the quintessential consumer staple, anchored by an unmatched global distribution network and an enduring brand moat. While top-line and earnings growth rates are more modest compared to tech and premier financials, KO provides highly stable, predictable cash flows and reliable shareholder returns that anchor a defensive posture.  RESULT: Formulated and presented the comprehensive bull case for AAPL, JPM, AXP, and KO based on point-in-time financial statements, economic moats, and free cash flow generation without executing orders." trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/ff16a031a5e8fc7b7309450ebc86307c60da90e8eb73035bc4dea3b3f4a666bb-20260923034604780937.json
